"note": "It says if non-cleartext IEs need to be sent then it should be sent in the **NAS message container IE,** including both clear and non-cleartext IEs.\n\nAnd that should be sent in the **SECURITY MODE COMPLETE** message when the UE doesn't have a valid 5G NAS security context.\n\nI believe this should clarify the confusion. OAI AMF accepts the non-cleartext IE in the InitialUEMessage when UE doesn't have a valid 5G security context - which is a violation of the specification.\n\n![Screenshot 2026-02-13 at 8.52.13\u202fAM.png](/uploads/8bb1cb58a4f0ebe3bef97356693bf87b/Screenshot_2026-02-13_at_8.52.13_AM.png){width=837 height=299}",
"note_html": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:148\" dir=\"auto\">It says if non-cleartext IEs need to be sent then it should be sent in the <strong data-sourcepos=\"1:76-1:104\">NAS message container IE,</strong> including both clear and non-cleartext IEs.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:123\" dir=\"auto\">And that should be sent in the <strong data-sourcepos=\"3:32-3:57\">SECURITY MODE COMPLETE</strong> message when the UE doesn't have a valid 5G NAS security context.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:199\" dir=\"auto\">I believe this should clarify the confusion. OAI AMF accepts the non-cleartext IE in the InitialUEMessage when UE doesn't have a valid 5G security context - which is a violation of the specification.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:149\" dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"no-attachment-icon gfm\" href=\"https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/-/project/2363/uploads/8bb1cb58a4f0ebe3bef97356693bf87b/Screenshot_2026-02-13_at_8.52.13_AM.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-canonical-src=\"/uploads/8bb1cb58a4f0ebe3bef97356693bf87b/Screenshot_2026-02-13_at_8.52.13_AM.png\" data-link=\"true\"><img data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:127\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-13 at 8.52.13\u202fAM.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"299\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazy gfm\" data-src=\"https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/-/project/2363/uploads/8bb1cb58a4f0ebe3bef97356693bf87b/Screenshot_2026-02-13_at_8.52.13_AM.png\" data-canonical-src=\"/uploads/8bb1cb58a4f0ebe3bef97356693bf87b/Screenshot_2026-02-13_at_8.52.13_AM.png\"></a></p>",
"body_first_line_html": "<p>It says if non-cleartext IEs need to be sent then it should be sent in the <strong>NAS message container IE,</strong> including both clear ...</p>",
